&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Payoneer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2005, Payoneer is the global financial platform that removes friction from doing business across borders, with a mission to connect the world’s underserved businesses to a rising global economy. We’re a community with over 2,500 colleagues all over the world, working to serve customers, and partners in over 190 countries and territories.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By taking the complexity out of the financial workflows–including everything from global payments and compliance to multi-currency and workforce management, to providing working capital and business intelligence–we give businesses the tools they need to work efficiently worldwide and grow with confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be spending your time on:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you someone who loves turning data into stories, insights into action, and numbers into strategy? As a Financial Planning &amp;amp; Analysis Manager at Payoneer, you’ll be a key player on the FP&amp;amp;A GTM team—helping influence the strategic direction of a global, fast‑growing business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you’ll dive deep into meaningful analysis, sharpen and enhance our financial policies, and partner closely with our global sales organization to drive smarter decisions and better outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re looking for a role where your ideas matter, your work has impact, and your career can grow globally—this is your place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role will report directly to our FP&amp;amp;A Senior Manager&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;based in Hong Kong, joining a dynamic team that values curiosity, collaboration, and continuous growth.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For this role you are also:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Business‑savvy mindset with the confidence to operate independently and make sound judgments with minimal guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detail‑driven and hands‑on, while still maintaining a broad, strategic, and global perspective&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical connector—able to trace how one business decision or action influences results across different functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive self‑starter who takes initiative, identifies opportunities, and drives solutions forward&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative communicator with strong interpersonal skills to partner effectively with cross‑functional teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to simplify complexity, turning intricate business models and data into clear, actionable financial insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you done this kind of stuff?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7-10 years of relevant professional experience in &lt;strong&gt;FP&amp;amp;A, Finance Business Partnering&lt;/strong&gt; or &lt;strong&gt;corporate finance (or similar)&lt;/strong&gt; in a global public company; fintech or payments experience a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding academic background from a top‑tier university, demonstrating strong analytical rigor and intellectual curiosity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Industry experience&lt;/strong&gt; in Banking, Payments, Fintech, E‑commerce, or broader Financial Services—ideal for thriving in our fast‑paced, data‑driven environment&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive global impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Support key initiatives across the Global FP&amp;amp;A–GTM team and GTM (sales) organization, contributing to projects that are local, global or product focused.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Turn numbers into insights:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze revenue and OPEX trends to uncover what’s working, what’s changing, and where opportunities lie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape our long‑range plans:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with business teams and regional FP&amp;amp;A leads to refine internal and external long range forecast.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build smarter processes:&lt;/strong&gt; Help standardize global workflows to ensure accuracy, consistency, and efficiency across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Elevate how we work:&lt;/strong&gt; Support the development of global FP&amp;amp;A policies, ROI templates, and best‑practice guidelines that help the business run better.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be hands-on with month‑end:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist with OPEX accruals, journal entries, and PO approvals—keeping our financial engine running smoothly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Plan the future:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to the annual budget cycle, quarterly forecasts, and long-term financial plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Spot big-picture trends:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze and Identify macro trends and business drivers that influence performance and strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tell the story of the business:&lt;/strong&gt; Prepare management reports, executive summaries, and dashboards that highlight insights for senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Keep performance on track:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor actual results vs. targets, with clear explanations and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build models that matter:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide financial modeling, pricing, and decision support to help guide strategic choices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support leadership and investors:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to materials for executives, Board of Directors, investor presentations, and quarterly earnings releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Assess ROI with real business impact:&lt;/strong&gt; Review investments and campaigns to ensure we’re investing wisely and driving returns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Track what matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and monitor KPIs that drive efficiency, effectiveness, and growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a team player:&lt;/strong&gt; Assist the broader FP&amp;amp;A team with recurring deliverables, deck preparation, and operational tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thrive in a fast-paced environment:&lt;/strong&gt; Support global teams with ad‑hoc requests—perfect for someone who enjoys variety and challenge.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not a must but a great advantage&lt;/strong&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SQL, BigQuery, Power BI&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Payoneer Ways of Working&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Act as our customer’s partner on the inside&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Learning what they need and creating what will help them go further.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Do it. Own it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Being fearlessly accountable in everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Continuously improve&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Always striving for a higher standard than our last.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
