&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is currently seeking an experienced Registered Nurse, RN, for a part time or prn opportunity performing home health visits for our Greenville Visits office. This office services adult and geriatric patients in homes throughout Spartanburg and Anderson counties in South Carolina.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
