&lt;li&gt;Manage configuration, networking, and access policies across cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain, and enhance CI/CD pipelines using Jenkins and GitHub Actions &amp;amp; Workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automate build, testing, and deployment processes to reduce manual effort and improve release velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement automated rollback, approval gates, and environment promotion workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with managing EKS clusters including provision, scaling, and troubleshooting Kubernetes networking and security in AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Containerize applications using Docker and deploy via ECS or EKS.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with configuring and fine-tuning observability stacks (Prometheus, Grafana, OTEL) for efficient monitoring, alerting, and troubleshooting at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with leveraging AI tools (e.g., GitHub Copilot) to assist in coding, testing, and automating DevOps tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in integration of AI-driven automation tools into CI/CD pipelines and Kubernetes management.&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Have you got what it takes?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience: 5-8 years of relevant DevOps or Cloud Engineering experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Kubernetes Platform Management EKS preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud Platforms: Strong expertise with AWS (EC2, ECS, EKS, S3, RDS, CloudFront, IAM, VPC, Route53).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IaC Tools: Proficiency with Terraform and AWS CloudFormation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Genuine curiosity and enthusiasm for applying AI tools and techniques to DevOps workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to explore AI-assisted development tools such as code assistants, automated testing aids, and prompt-based automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Openness to learning how AI can improve build, deployment, and operational processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to quickly adopt new AI tools and incorporate them into daily work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to evaluate AI tools and assess their practical value for CI/CD and infrastructure automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expected to prototype and integrate AI-driven solutions into existing pipelines and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute ideas and feedback to the team&#39;s AI adoption strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with emerging AI tooling relevant to DevOps and share findings with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to evaluate an AI tool&#39;s fit for a specific CI/CD challenge and articulate trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
